>> Animal := Walax cusub.
Animal marka: ['sound:'] samee: { :s iska-leh sound := s. }.
Animal marka: ['makeSound'] samee: { Soo-saar qor: iska-leh sound. }.
>> Cat := Animal cusub.
Cat marka: ['init'] samee: { iska-leh sound := ['MEOW!'].}.
Cat marka: ['meow'] samee: { naf makeSound. }.
Cat init.
Cat meow.
